Subject: [PATCH] Add Media Monitor Malaysia: free Meltwater-style media
 monitoring dashboard

Aggregates 20+ Malaysian RSS feeds (BM/EN/ZH/TA outlets plus Google News
MY) server-side with no paid APIs, and analyses coverage with rule-based
NLP tuned for local nuance:

- Language detection incl. Manglish/bahasa rojak 'mixed' register
- Sentiment lexicon for BM, Manglish slang, English and basic Chinese,
  with BM negation (tak/bukan/jangan) and intensifiers (memang/gila)
- Entity dictionary for parties, agencies (KWSP/EPF, SPRM/MACC aliases),
  GLCs, states and recurring national issues

Dashboard at /monitor: keyword tracking saved in localStorage, sentiment
timeline, share of voice, language mix charts, filterable mention feed
and per-feed health reporting. Nav link added in EN and BM.

